{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/bf52af61ad51cf908d84c336ba11be38.poster.avif?t=1764086505\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/bf52af61ad51cf908d84c336ba11be38.webm?t=1764086505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/bf52af61ad51cf908d84c336ba11be38.mp4?t=1764086505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/3ae0e60866d84c6ff644e2616ce9f689.avif?t=1764086505\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras_big/3ae0e60866d84c6ff644e2616ce9f689.webp?t=1764086505 width=1560 height=519 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom boards with new layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not limited to the standard pieces, let your creativity out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with an aggressive forward assault, Or perhaps a defensive fortress designed to weather the storm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's like chess but with deckbuilding and dragons...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you outwit, outmanoeuvre, or out-explode your way to victory?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/a0a1c0f746167b1b5d27365ae87c77b8.avif?t=1764086505\" data-bi